{
  "_comment": [
    "Common symptoms and examination findings.",
    "",
    "These exist so the editor can complete them and so a note can render a",
    "readable label for shorthand. They are vocabulary, not a checklist: the",
    "engine never suggests that a finding should have been recorded, never",
    "infers one from another, and a term absent from this file is still",
    "accepted and rendered exactly as typed.",
    "",
    "This list replaces a hardcoded Go map in the autocomplete package, which",
    "was a third source of clinical vocabulary alongside the lexicon and the",
    "parser tables and had already drifted from both. A clinic can extend this",
    "file through the same .config override as every other lexicon file.",
    "",
    "Prefer hyphens over underscores in multi-word terms: a hyphen needs no",
    "shift key and the language keeps it inside a single token."
  ],

